{"data": {"event": {"id": "1b7097c5-ad9a-42a5-baf0-db716433b16b", "picture": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/1132/video/thumbs/poster.jpg", "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance p\u00e9dagogique", "sessionTypeColor": "#44bdfa", "voting": null, "title": "Imagerie ost\u00e9oarticulaire et poignet", "start": "2026-10-10T15:30+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T16:30+02:00", "objectives": ["<div>\u2022<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>D\u00e9velopper une connaissance pr\u00e9cise des diff\u00e9rents signes cliniques d\u2019instabilit\u00e9 et une compr\u00e9hension de la biom\u00e9canique du poignet pour d\u00e9tecter les l\u00e9sions d\u2019instabilit\u00e9 du carpe.</div>", "<div>\u2022<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Savoir faire un diagnostic pr\u00e9coce d\u2019une fracture du scapho\u00efde pour avoir une prise en charge initiale adapt\u00e9e. Savoir faire le bilan d\u2019une pseudarthrose, reconna\u00eetre un DISI adaptatif et juger de la viabilit\u00e9 du fragment proximal.</div>", "<div>\u2022<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Savoir \u00e9valuer les l\u00e9sions d\u2019instabilit\u00e9s radio-ulnaire distales et les l\u00e9sions de l\u2019ECU, \u00e0 l\u2019origine des douleurs ulnaires du carpe</div>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "b2cdf3e0-ef93-4444-844a-94ea26aab669", "name": "252", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "04f9b648-7a7c-4d46-a02e-5d5e1807f78d", "title": "Instabilit\u00e9 dissociative et non dissociative du poignet", "start": "2026-10-10T15:30+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T15:45+02:00", "element": {"abstract": null}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "e0f651ba-92f0-477c-ab84-f0145c9864d3", "lastName": "Theumann", "firstName": "Nicolas", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphoto.aspx?idPhoto=237453&t=1"}, "country": {"name": "Suisse"}, "city": {"nam